ure) Analyzes job postings to auto-tailor resumes and cover letters.",\n      "isEnabled": false\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Multilingual Support",\n      "description": "(Future) Enables document generation in multiple languages.",\n      "isEnabled": false\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "LinkedIn Integration",\n      "description": "(Future) Imports experience directly from LinkedIn to populate sections.",\n      "isEnabled": false\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#0ff0fc",\n    "secondary": "#1a1a2e",\n    "accent": "#ff00cc"\n  },\n  "theme": "dark",\n  "layoutDescription": "A vibrant, neon-glitter themed interface with glowing accent elements. The main layout features a split view: form inputs on the left, live document preview on the right. Top navigation bar for template selection and export options. Floating action buttons for adding/reordering sections. Modern, readable fonts with neon highlights and glittery effects for buttons and section headers."\n}'}",
